sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Buyer
    participant Q as Virtual queue
    participant API as Order API
    participant Inv as Inventory
    participant Pay as Payment
    U->>Q: arrive at on-sale
    Q-->>U: admitted with a signed token
    Note over Q: the queue is the load shedder — it keeps the stampede off inventory
    U->>API: place order with the token
    API->>Inv: atomic decrement of remaining stock
    alt stock claimed
        Inv-->>API: reserved, short TTL
        API->>Pay: charge
        alt paid
            Pay->>Inv: commit the sale
            API-->>U: confirmed
        else failed or timed out
            Inv->>Inv: return the unit to the pool
            API-->>U: released
        end
    else sold out
        Inv-->>U: fail fast, do not queue behind a lock
    end
